{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014_02_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e8e94daa4dfb18642f4f6b686f43887aaee720d8beff08f3b58c617f3ce2b52f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74a62bbe7d3958f6702b99aa8f9f467d3c24cc07afc42c4271cced32d4e2f6cf",
      "text": "我说。偶像这行，\n是能让人这么热血沸腾的事情吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:854062668223e37728191f9736fe172eabf60e866df66c28d1e2c033768d5573",
      "text": "说到底，到底是做什么的啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a898a8b64fb58e5c05fa2605e3ff874b8226d656c8e40c9746315da803535a02",
      "text": "这个嘛～……唱歌跳舞，用帅气的\n表演，给大家带来笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78689f605518cf36f3d9036417e78b71ea1b3124f85bf8d519e6772c4b98508e",
      "text": "我是为了成为帅气的男人，\n才开始以偶像为目标的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7d4bc9afbe49a89ec6bfbf0f9661e6bb27657b0eac168a13cdf4bf2057a4f6f",
      "text": "虽然经历了很多事，结果作为女性偶像\n出道了就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6b074bd74b43c732e07e35401864e187856cc26cf5f1fbd2cd46e5d59572cce",
      "text": "接下来我会在一家叫315 Production的事务所，\n作为男性偶像重新开始！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6a2338fe176be8f424ac51ea48fb99b5b7f24c2ce965a4e9e9ee23e2f54397a",
      "text": "嚯～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a13b2074fcc73eb69f04fec7db4a1209342b66d916d291e997a1f0aa0803225",
      "text": "（唱歌跳舞，给大家带来笑容，吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a07aa5a576f5d62bbb2ae808a2a236cbc3465bf1b189cbd7e9c315a86c7331d",
      "text": "嗯，应该，能重新开始吧……石川社长也说了，\n已经好好跟315 Pro打过招呼了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15a42efd3dc75a7283841af47d28b4a04c6f13603629639b908d6086fa95d9a",
      "text": "哎呀，已经这个时间了！？\n得赶紧去事务所了，不然约好的时间要迟到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7c670fdbe8a5656de030fa42353e8c8a5cb302425f01066c31cf30ebd10bcfc",
      "text": "噢，那把你拉住真是抱歉了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05623913f69f66ebf6256a2c83c1f334e258bd0a6ea46b70e7c5e20ad8207c17",
      "text": "作为赔罪，俺送你去那个事务所吧。\n要是再被奇怪的家伙纠缠，就交给俺吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
